  "title": "Onesa: foreign DVC verified against the GDHCN trust list",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "How it is used: J3a. The district EHR verifies each Taifafeki DVC offline against its cached copy of the GDHCN trust list, then imports the dose. This record says so.\n\nWhy: a verified dose replaces a reported one, so the record must show who verified what, against which policy, and which reported doses it removes. Anyone who later doubts a dose can follow this record back to the signed certificate and the issuing country's key.",
